▶️ How to Run
1️⃣ Clone the Repository
git clone https://github.com/jc181755-lang/budget-tracker.git
cd budget-tracker


⚠️ Make sure the repository name above matches the actual GitHub repository name exactly.

2️⃣ (Optional) Install Color Support
pip install colorama

3️⃣ Run the Program
python main.py


If your system uses python3, run:

python3 main.py


The program will start immediately and display the main menu.

